# Walls in the 3/4 view: a 16 px top (autotiled: wall/top-<mask>, N=1 E=2 S=4 W=8 = connected) plus a
# 32 px face (face-hi above face-lo) on the two rows south of an east–west wall. Theme slots: W V U wall
# ramp, T trim, A B accent. "~ = ^" are translucent glass keys.

@frame wall/top
@meta {"autotile":true,"edge":"T","solid":true}
